sequenceDiagram
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant GuardrailSvc as Guardrail Service
    participant NERModel as NER Model
    participant RedactionRepo as RedactionSpan Repository
    participant MessageRepo as Message Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    Note over OrchSvc: During message processing

    OrchSvc->>GuardrailSvc: Scan message text
    GuardrailSvc->>GuardrailSvc: Pattern matching
    Note over GuardrailSvc: Detect:<br/>- Email addresses (regex)<br/>- Phone numbers<br/>- SSNs<br/>- Credit cards

    GuardrailSvc->>NERModel: Named Entity Recognition
    Note over NERModel: Detect entities<br/>that may be PII<br/>(names, addresses)
    NERModel-->>GuardrailSvc: Entity spans

    loop For each detected PII span
        Note over GuardrailSvc: Record:<br/>- start position<br/>- end position<br/>- label (EMAIL, PHONE, etc.)

        GuardrailSvc->>RedactionRepo: Create RedactionSpan<br/>{messageId, spans: [{start, end, label}]}
    end

    alt Configuration mode
        Note over GuardrailSvc: Mask mode:<br/>Replace with [REDACTED]/[EMAIL]

        Note over GuardrailSvc: Flag mode:<br/>Flag but don't modify

        Note over GuardrailSvc: Audit mode:<br/>Log for compliance
    end

    GuardrailSvc->>MessageRepo: Store message<br/>- Original (authorized access)<br/>- Redacted (general display)

    GuardrailSvc->>EventBus: Emit pii.detected<br/>{messageId, spans}

    Note over MessageRepo: On retrieval:<br/>- Regular users: redacted<br/>- Admins with PII access: original

    GuardrailSvc-->>OrchSvc: PII processing complete